PLACEHOLDER - not a real PyTorch checkpoint.

Replace this file with the trained MobileNetV2 `state_dict` from Google Colab, saved via
`torch.save(model.state_dict(), "model.pth")`, keeping this exact filename/path
(backend/app/ml/checkpoints/model.pth). No code changes are needed after replacing it —
